﻿1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.360
¿Qué tal un poco de magia?

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.240
Get your hands off me, pervert!

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:06.280
Come down!

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:07.760
Oh, here they are.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.400
These are the keys to the container

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.480
with your paintings.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:16.520
Take them.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.600
So you’re playing a hero now?

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.240
They were messing

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.760
with the wrong guy.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.120
After they killed your grandfather...

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.400
That's a lie!

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.160
You've also fallen for that Aspen girl!

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.240
What's...

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.400
What's wrong with you all?

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.160
Calm down.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.560
Listen, I'm a victim too.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.240
He forced me into this.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.240
She's the one...

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.720
No, no, no no. Don't listen to her.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:45.080
She's the one who injected

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:46.960
 your grandfather with the drug.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.440
What?
